"Per OpenMV firmware v%(omv)s · basato su MicroPython v%(mpy)s · "
"documentazione aggiornata %(date)s"

msgid "Forums"
msgstr "Forum"

msgid "GENX320 event sensor + PAG7936 colour on one module."
msgstr "Sensore eventi GENX320 + colore PAG7936 in un unico modulo."

msgid "Gigabit Ethernet with PoE for higher-bandwidth streaming."
msgstr "Gigabit Ethernet con PoE per streaming ad alta larghezza di banda."

msgid ""
"Google's BlazeFace is a lightweight TensorFlow Lite face detector that "
"returns bounding boxes plus six landmarks per face."
msgstr ""
"Google's BlazeFace is a lightweight TensorFlow Lite face detector that "
"returns bounding boxes plus six landmarks per face."

msgid ""
"Google's MediaPipe Hand Landmarks model places 21 joints on each detected "
"hand — wrist, knuckles, and fingertips."
msgstr ""
"Google's MediaPipe Hand Landmarks model places 21 joints on each detected "
"hand — wrist, knuckles, and fingertips."

msgid "Hand landmarks"
msgstr "Punti di riferimento della mano"

msgid "Hardware"
msgstr "Hardware"

msgid ""
"Hardware, cameras, image processing, ndarrays, ML, multitasking, networking,"
" web servers, and Bluetooth — all from MicroPython."
msgstr ""
"Hardware, fotocamere, elaborazione immagini, ndarray, ML, multitasking, "
"networking, server web e Bluetooth — tutto da MicroPython."

msgid "Hello world"
msgstr "Hello world"

msgid "Home"
msgstr "Home"

msgid "Internals"
msgstr "Struttura interna"

msgid "Language"
msgstr "Linguaggio"

msgid "Language reference, syntax, and core runtime semantics."
msgstr "Riferimento del linguaggio, sintassi e semantica del runtime di base."

msgid "Libraries"
msgstr "Librerie principali"

msgid "License"
msgstr "Licenza"

msgid ""
"Live face detection, AprilTag tracking, QR scanning, and YOLO. All on-device"
" in pure MicroPython. No host computer, no cloud."
msgstr ""
"Rilevamento volti in tempo reale, tracciamento AprilTag, scansione QR e "
"YOLO. Tutto sul dispositivo in puro MicroPython. Nessun computer host, "
"nessun cloud."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — pre-quantised, no"
" download needed."
msgstr ""
"Caricato da <code>/rom/blazeface_front_128.tflite</code> — pre-quantizzato, "
"nessun download necessario."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — running "
"standalone here, without palm detection upstream."
msgstr ""
"Caricato da <code>/rom/hand_landmarks_full_224.tflite</code> — eseguito in "
"modo standalone, senza rilevamento del palmo a monte."

msgid ""
"Loaded from <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — no SD card or download "
"needed."
msgstr ""
"Caricato da <code>/rom/yolov8n_192.tflite</code> — nessuna scheda SD o "
"download necessario."

msgid "Locate and identify AprilTags"
msgstr "Localizza e identifica gli AprilTag"

msgid "Low-level hardware: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC, and timers."
msgstr "Hardware di basso livello: GPIO, SPI, I²C, UART, PWM, ADC e timer."

msgid "Machine vision,<br>made simple."
msgstr "Machine vision,<br>resa semplice."

msgid "Machine vision: blobs, edges, lines, circles, features, and drawing."
msgstr "Machine vision: blob, bordi, linee, cerchi, feature e disegno."

msgid ""
"Made with <a href=\"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/\">Sphinx</a> using the <a "
"href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."
msgstr ""
"Realizzato con <a href=\"https://www.sphinx-doc.org/\">Sphinx</a> "
"utilizzando il <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."

msgid "Made with the <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."
msgstr ""
"Realizzato con il <a href=\"https://shibuya.lepture.com\">Shibuya theme</a>."

