"Where MicroPython diverges from standard Python — modules, builtins, and "
"syntax."
msgstr ""
"Dove MicroPython si discosta da Python standard — moduli, builtin e "
"sintassi."

msgid "Wi-Fi, Ethernet, and sockets for IoT and remote communication."
msgstr "Wi-Fi, Ethernet e socket per IoT e comunicazione remota."

msgid "YOLOv8 person tracking"
msgstr "Tracciamento persone con YOLOv8"
